# IMPORTANT for Render: the free Web Service plan has an ephemeral disk.
# Any file written under uploads/ is wiped on the next deploy / instance
# restart. Uploads/ is still .gitignored above so the deployed copies stay
# empty until a runtime write. Long-term fix: replace the file path in
# api/upload.php with an S3 (or compatible) PUT call when S3_BUCKET env
# vars are present — see DEPLOY.md "Known limitations" for context.
